{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Remio.RemioHost","latestVersion":"3.4.5","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Stream your Windows PC to any device with native, GPU-accelerated remote desktop.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://remio.net/terms","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Stream your Windows PC to any device with native, GPU-accelerated remote desktop.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://remio.net/terms","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Remio Host turns your Windows PC into a streaming target that any Remio client (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Android, Windows) can connect to over the local network or the internet.\n\nBuilt from scratch with native WinUI 3 - no Electron, no browser wrappers. Full GPU-accelerated H.264/H.265 screen capture, loopback audio, multi-monitor support, drag-and-drop file transfer, clipboard sync, and gamepad passthrough. Runs as a Windows Service so it survives reboots and log-offs.\n\nIncludes built-in auto-updates via WinSparkle (EdDSA-signed end-to-end), so you always have the latest version with one click.","moniker":"remiohost","name":"Remio Host","packageUrl":"https://remio.net/download.html","publisher":"Remio","publisherUrl":"https://remio.net","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/remioapp/releases/releases/tag/v3.4.5-win","tags":["remote-desktop","streaming","remote-control","moonlight","screen-share","host","rdp-alternative","winui3","native","webrtc"]}},"longDescription":"Remio Host turns your Windows PC into a streaming target that any Remio client (iPhone, iPad, Mac, Android, Windows) can connect to over the local network or the internet.\n\nBuilt from scratch with native WinUI 3 - no Electron, no browser wrappers. Full GPU-accelerated H.264/H.265 screen capture, loopback audio, multi-monitor support, drag-and-drop file transfer, clipboard sync, and gamepad passthrough. Runs as a Windows Service so it survives reboots and log-offs.\n\nIncludes built-in auto